1
00:00:13,555 --> 00:00:14,764
This is Ranma

2
00:00:14,848 --> 00:00:17,600
of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

3
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:24,357
And living within the Tendo Dojo is Akane.

4
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:28,862
These two teens were arranged
to be married by their parents.

5
00:00:28,945 --> 00:00:30,363
You're not the boss of me.

6
00:00:30,447 --> 00:00:31,614
How annoying!

7
00:00:31,698 --> 00:00:34,200
But Ranma suffers
with a small problem.

8
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,957
Whenever he's splashed with cold water,
he transforms into a girl.

9
00:00:46,296 --> 00:00:50,550
RANMA1/2

10
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:15,093
KODACHI, THE BLACK ROSE

11
00:02:32,110 --> 00:02:33,862
They gave me an extra for free.

12
00:02:33,945 --> 00:02:35,989
Huh, being a girl's not so bad.

13
00:02:36,072 --> 00:02:37,949
At least when I'm trying to buy food.

14
00:02:38,032 --> 00:02:40,368
You must be
from Furinkan High School.

15
00:02:40,451 --> 00:02:41,619
Hmm?

16
00:02:41,703 --> 00:02:43,413
You silly fools.

17
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,499
You have less than a week to wait
until we face off.

18
00:02:46,583 --> 00:02:48,418
So why are you so eager to rush?

19
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:50,712
We don't wanna hear it.

20
00:02:50,795 --> 00:02:52,380
It's time to end our grudge.

21
00:02:52,463 --> 00:02:54,215
We'll wipe you out, right here and now!

22
00:02:54,299 --> 00:02:57,177
Hmm.
Did I miss the bandage convention?

23
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,386
Prepare yourself!

24
00:03:04,976 --> 00:03:08,146
You won't understand. Not with words.

25
00:03:10,106 --> 00:03:12,150
Since you refuse to listen...

26
00:03:13,067 --> 00:03:14,068
Take this!

27
00:03:16,070 --> 00:03:18,573
Hear me now? You fools!

28
00:03:20,950 --> 00:03:22,994
We can stop that now.

29
00:03:23,077 --> 00:03:25,288
It's pretty obvious to me you already won.

30
00:03:25,788 --> 00:03:28,833
How did you see through
my ribbon technique so easily?

31
00:03:29,667 --> 00:03:33,338
Tell me, girl.
You're not just any woman, are you?

32
00:03:33,421 --> 00:03:35,840
Yeah, you could
definitely put it that way.

33
00:03:36,925 --> 00:03:38,218
Amusing.

34
00:03:40,803 --> 00:03:42,180
I won't hold back.

35
00:03:42,263 --> 00:03:44,307
Women still get my full force!

36
00:03:54,943 --> 00:03:57,487
I see you're much stronger
than those fools.

37
00:03:57,570 --> 00:04:00,865
I'm a student going to
the St. Bacchus' School for Girls.

38
00:04:02,367 --> 00:04:03,993
Kodachi the Black Rose.

39
00:04:04,077 --> 00:04:06,329
You will do well to remember it.

40
00:04:13,253 --> 00:04:15,046
Hmm?

41
00:04:17,257 --> 00:04:20,802
- How can we live?
- It's a disaster.

42
00:04:20,885 --> 00:04:22,762
Quit your whining and try to act like men.

43
00:04:22,845 --> 00:04:23,846
Huh?

44
00:04:23,930 --> 00:04:25,473
How could you think we're boys?

45
00:04:25,556 --> 00:04:27,850
We're Furinkan's rhythmic gymnastics team.

46
00:04:27,934 --> 00:04:29,310
We have a club.

47
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:33,940
I know these girls.
I think we're in the same class.

48
00:04:34,774 --> 00:04:35,984
ANYTHING GOES MARTIAL ARTS
TENDO DOJO

49
00:04:36,067 --> 00:04:38,069
All the rhythmic gymnastics
members are injured?

50
00:04:38,152 --> 00:04:40,405
We were completely ambushed.

51
00:04:40,488 --> 00:04:42,991
By none other than Kodachi the Black Rose.

52
00:04:43,074 --> 00:04:45,535
I've never heard of the Black Rose.

53
00:04:45,618 --> 00:04:48,329
We were less than a week away
from having a match against her.

54
00:04:48,413 --> 00:04:50,790
With the way we are now,
we'll have to withdraw.

55
00:04:50,873 --> 00:04:54,377
So, why me? You want me
to fill in for you or something?

56
00:04:55,003 --> 00:04:58,548
We came to ask you for help
because we have no other options, Akane.

57
00:04:58,631 --> 00:05:00,883
Because the theme of
the match that was happening was...

58
00:05:00,967 --> 00:05:05,013
Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics!
It's beautiful!

59
00:05:05,096 --> 00:05:07,015
I haven't heard of that before.

60
00:05:07,098 --> 00:05:08,641
Yeah, what the heck is it?

61
00:05:08,725 --> 00:05:09,726
Just that!

62
00:05:09,809 --> 00:05:12,061
Our school representatives are going
to face off,

63
00:05:12,145 --> 00:05:14,939
- using the power of rhythmic gymnastics.
- Hmm?

64
00:05:15,023 --> 00:05:16,024
ILLUSTRATION

65
00:05:17,442 --> 00:05:18,609
Copy that.

66
00:05:20,028 --> 00:05:21,070
Akane!

67
00:05:21,154 --> 00:05:24,657
You're the only person left who stands
a chance against the Black Rose.

68
00:05:24,741 --> 00:05:26,826
- Akane.
- Can't you see we're begging?

69
00:05:27,410 --> 00:05:31,372
Right. I don't think I'm
quite getting it yet, but I'll do it.

70
00:05:33,499 --> 00:05:35,918
I'll do whatever I can
to avenge all of you.

71
00:05:36,002 --> 00:05:37,170
Thank you!

72
00:05:37,253 --> 00:05:40,673
Thank you, Akane!

73
00:05:40,757 --> 00:05:41,883
DOJO ENTRANCE THIS WAY

74
00:05:41,966 --> 00:05:44,177
I can't believe
you took this on so quickly.

75
00:05:44,844 --> 00:05:47,138
Also, can you wield these?

76
00:05:47,221 --> 00:05:48,306
I'm not sure.

77
00:05:48,389 --> 00:05:50,058
I've never used them before.

78
00:05:50,141 --> 00:05:51,851
Even so, how hard could it be?

79
00:05:51,934 --> 00:05:53,603
Is that really your plan?

80
00:05:53,686 --> 00:05:54,896
Hmm?

81
00:05:54,979 --> 00:05:56,272
Hey, there!

82
00:05:56,356 --> 00:05:59,525
Aw, where have you been, cutie?

83
00:05:59,609 --> 00:06:00,943
Come here, you.

84
00:06:04,489 --> 00:06:07,116
I was getting worried about you, P-chan.

85
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,451
P-chan?

86
00:06:08,534 --> 00:06:10,119
'Cause he's just a little piggy.

87
00:06:10,203 --> 00:06:11,579
"P" as in pig, you know?

88
00:06:11,662 --> 00:06:13,122
Wow.

89
00:06:13,206 --> 00:06:15,291
I guess you two have gotten
pretty close, huh?

90
00:06:15,375 --> 00:06:17,377
Yeah. So? Of course we are.

91
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:19,545
That's what happens
when you sleep together every night.

92
00:06:19,629 --> 00:06:20,630
Every night?

93
00:06:20,713 --> 00:06:22,382
Right?

94
00:06:22,465 --> 00:06:24,509
But sometimes you disappear on me.

95
00:06:24,592 --> 00:06:27,637
P-chan, be a good boy and stay right here.

96
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,597
Ranma, don't pick on him, okay?

97
00:06:33,684 --> 00:06:34,685
Hmm?

98
00:06:39,107 --> 00:06:40,691
So, Ryoga.

99
00:06:40,775 --> 00:06:43,903
I suppose this means that
you've mentally turned into a pig too.

100
00:06:45,238 --> 00:06:47,365
You clinging to Akane like that
is so pathetic.

101
00:06:51,411 --> 00:06:54,288
I told you not to pick on that piggy!

102
00:06:55,039 --> 00:06:56,416
Here goes nothing.

103
00:07:07,301 --> 00:07:09,720
Were they supposed to drop like that, or...

104
00:07:10,721 --> 00:07:12,598
You know that they weren't.

105
00:07:12,682 --> 00:07:15,059
Let's try the ribbon then.

106
00:07:16,144 --> 00:07:17,145
Okay!

107
00:07:18,229 --> 00:07:20,022
How's this?

108
00:07:20,523 --> 00:07:21,816
Uh...

109
00:07:21,899 --> 00:07:24,235
Are you supposed to be
wrapped up like that?

110
00:07:24,861 --> 00:07:26,279
I need you to shut up.

111
00:07:27,196 --> 00:07:28,489
All right!

112
00:07:35,538 --> 00:07:38,458
Is shattering the hoop
supposed to be part of it?

113
00:07:38,541 --> 00:07:41,961
That's it! I hate this thing!

114
00:07:42,044 --> 00:07:45,298
The worst part is I think you
might be the sorest loser I've ever seen.

115
00:07:45,381 --> 00:07:46,883
I said shut it!

116
00:07:47,383 --> 00:07:48,759
I will if you will.

117
00:08:12,658 --> 00:08:14,494
Okay! I get it.

118
00:08:14,577 --> 00:08:17,121
I suck at this.
And I'm never gonna get any better at it.

119
00:08:17,205 --> 00:08:19,457
Don't act like it's my fault.

120
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:21,000
Would you like me to coach you?

121
00:08:21,083 --> 00:08:22,001
- Oh?
- Hmm?

122
00:08:23,586 --> 00:08:24,795
Ryoga?

123
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:27,715
What's goin' on, P-chan?

124
00:08:27,798 --> 00:08:29,675
Who are you calling P-chan?

125
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,427
I don't know. You tell me.

126
00:08:31,511 --> 00:08:33,971
Thank you, Ryoga.
You are so compassionate.

127
00:08:34,555 --> 00:08:35,973
Oh, yeah?

128
00:08:38,351 --> 00:08:39,352
Hmm.

129
00:08:40,394 --> 00:08:41,479
Ribbon.

130
00:08:47,026 --> 00:08:48,444
Incredible!

131
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:49,570
It was nothing.

132
00:08:50,071 --> 00:08:51,697
You bastard.

133
00:09:00,414 --> 00:09:02,542
That will be enough for today's training.

134
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:04,710
Thank you for all of your help.

135
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:08,381
The way you handled the ribbon
was quite good.

136
00:09:09,131 --> 00:09:10,591
I'm sure you'll get better soon.

137
00:09:11,133 --> 00:09:13,052
You mean that, Ryoga?

138
00:09:13,594 --> 00:09:15,680
Sure, if you wanna believe a blatant lie.

139
00:09:15,763 --> 00:09:18,057
I thought I told you to shut your mouth.

140
00:09:19,934 --> 00:09:21,519
It's so much pressure.

141
00:09:21,602 --> 00:09:25,273
I have less than a week to master
an entirely new form of martial arts.

142
00:09:25,898 --> 00:09:27,525
Maybe this was a mistake.

143
00:09:27,608 --> 00:09:29,527
I really shouldn't have agreed to help.

144
00:09:30,194 --> 00:09:33,030
This is gonna be
painful to watch.

145
00:09:33,114 --> 00:09:35,616
I mean, you're obviously
completely shameless.

146
00:09:35,700 --> 00:09:37,201
Such a little suck-up.

147
00:09:37,702 --> 00:09:40,538
Jealousy is unbecoming, you know.

148
00:09:40,621 --> 00:09:42,915
Who are you calling jealous?

149
00:09:42,999 --> 00:09:44,500
Hmm?

150
00:09:46,627 --> 00:09:49,255
That's how it is, huh?

151
00:09:49,338 --> 00:09:52,842
You just want to sneak off
and snuggle into bed with Akane.

152
00:09:56,679 --> 00:09:57,847
Get back here!

153
00:10:05,146 --> 00:10:07,064
So you're calling for backup.

154
00:10:07,607 --> 00:10:11,819
Furinkan High's rhythmic gymnasts don't
seem to realize when they should give up.

155
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,280
And here I thought I taught them a lesson.

156
00:10:17,199 --> 00:10:18,743
All right, Akane Tendo.

157
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:28,753
Beware the thorns of the Black Rose.
Or your blood will be the first to spill.

158
00:10:34,842 --> 00:10:36,510
I'm so tired.

159
00:10:37,011 --> 00:10:38,971
This regimen has been intense.

160
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:41,182
Akane Tendo.

161
00:10:41,724 --> 00:10:43,309
Hmm?

162
00:10:47,396 --> 00:10:49,857
The time is now!

163
00:10:51,776 --> 00:10:53,152
Who are you?

164
00:10:54,695 --> 00:10:58,491
I'm one of the rhythmic gymnasts
from St. Bacchus' School for Girls.

165
00:10:58,574 --> 00:10:59,992
Kodachi the Black Rose.

166
00:11:01,786 --> 00:11:04,622
You and I will fight next week.

167
00:11:04,705 --> 00:11:06,582
I'm just here to wish you well,...

168
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:09,210
...and to ensure
we have a nice, clean fight.

169
00:11:12,588 --> 00:11:14,006
You could've fooled me.

170
00:11:14,090 --> 00:11:17,134
This feels way more like a sneak attack!

171
00:11:19,261 --> 00:11:20,262
It was you!

172
00:11:20,346 --> 00:11:23,224
You must've been the one
who ambushed those girls from my school.

173
00:11:23,307 --> 00:11:25,518
So uncivilized to call it an ambush.

174
00:11:26,102 --> 00:11:28,104
My philosophy in war is simple.

175
00:11:28,187 --> 00:11:31,357
I must do everything within my power
to win before a match.

176
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,317
Yeah, but isn't this unfair?

177
00:11:33,401 --> 00:11:34,860
Unfair?

178
00:11:34,944 --> 00:11:37,780
A match begins long before
either of us get on the stage.

179
00:11:37,863 --> 00:11:39,740
What is that supposed to mean?

180
00:11:39,824 --> 00:11:41,992
I welcome you to return the blow--

181
00:11:43,244 --> 00:11:44,412
Get back here!

182
00:11:45,663 --> 00:11:47,790
You little...

183
00:11:47,873 --> 00:11:49,625
Quit jumping around!

184
00:11:51,502 --> 00:11:53,337
I told you to stop!

185
00:11:55,339 --> 00:11:56,340
Hey!

186
00:11:56,841 --> 00:11:58,134
- Damn it.
- Uh...

187
00:11:58,217 --> 00:12:01,262
Hey! Ranma, leave P-chan alone!

188
00:12:01,345 --> 00:12:02,805
Hyah!

189
00:12:07,810 --> 00:12:09,186
Akane Tendo.

190
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:12,189
I see you're just as strong
as the rumors implied.

191
00:12:12,898 --> 00:12:14,817
I will be coming back.

192
00:12:15,401 --> 00:12:16,736
Are those rose petals?

193
00:12:23,409 --> 00:12:26,912
So I'm the one that gets stuck
cleaning up your mess? For real?

194
00:12:28,456 --> 00:12:30,124
Akane, are you done?

195
00:12:30,207 --> 00:12:32,042
Can we stop hosting fights at night?

196
00:12:32,126 --> 00:12:33,335
Need my beauty sleep.

197
00:12:33,419 --> 00:12:35,379
Kodachi the Black Rose.

198
00:12:35,463 --> 00:12:38,424
I'm gonna pay back all this and more
at the match.

199
00:12:40,092 --> 00:12:41,552
Akane Tendo.

200
00:12:42,303 --> 00:12:45,556
I'm going to crush you
long before the match ever happens.

201
00:12:48,976 --> 00:12:49,977
A pig?

202
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,854
Wait, Ryoga!

203
00:12:55,441 --> 00:12:57,568
Huh?

204
00:13:05,409 --> 00:13:07,369
Are you feeling okay?

205
00:13:13,918 --> 00:13:16,003
He's so handsome.

206
00:13:16,086 --> 00:13:19,173
Hmm? Is this
that Kodachi Black Rose person?

207
00:13:20,549 --> 00:13:22,176
- Hmm? Hmm?
- Hmm.

208
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:24,428
I... I...

209
00:13:24,512 --> 00:13:26,430
I was so scared.

210
00:13:26,514 --> 00:13:28,057
Hey, wait a second.

211
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:29,934
Uh, what is this?

212
00:13:30,017 --> 00:13:33,896
Going to a girls' school feels
like living in monochrome without romance.

213
00:13:33,979 --> 00:13:36,357
I could only practice rhythmic gymnastics.

214
00:13:36,941 --> 00:13:40,778
I'd almost given up hope
of knowing the beautiful touch of a man!

215
00:13:42,071 --> 00:13:46,867
I never imagined
such a sweet encounter would await me.

216
00:13:48,452 --> 00:13:50,663
Uh, sir, what is your name?

217
00:13:50,746 --> 00:13:53,374
I'm, uh, Ranma.

218
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:56,961
- Lord Ranma, these are for you.
- Hmm?

219
00:14:03,008 --> 00:14:06,303
I took the liberty of sprinkling
some anesthetics into the bouquet.

220
00:14:06,387 --> 00:14:09,348
Why would you
do something like that?

221
00:14:10,349 --> 00:14:11,725
Mmm?

222
00:14:11,809 --> 00:14:13,644
Listen, Lord Ranma.

223
00:14:13,727 --> 00:14:16,480
You really must have more courage.

224
00:14:18,232 --> 00:14:20,359
These lips are yours to take.

225
00:14:20,442 --> 00:14:24,280
Go on. Steal them if you must.

226
00:14:24,363 --> 00:14:26,824
Mmm...

227
00:14:27,491 --> 00:14:31,036
If you're gonna do weird stuff,
don't do it over my room!

228
00:14:32,371 --> 00:14:35,708
Well, what a shame
for us to get interrupted.

229
00:14:37,084 --> 00:14:40,629
Lord Ranma, we'll meet again!

230
00:14:40,713 --> 00:14:42,506
What the hell was the deal with her?

231
00:14:44,675 --> 00:14:45,759
Hmph.

232
00:14:46,969 --> 00:14:49,638
Sorry to interrupt
whatever you two were doing.

233
00:14:49,722 --> 00:14:50,848
Enjoy your dreams.

234
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:53,183
I was pathetic.

235
00:14:57,688 --> 00:14:59,857
Kodachi the Black Rose.

236
00:15:01,150 --> 00:15:04,194
Oh, I don't ever wanna have to
lose to her.

237
00:15:06,655 --> 00:15:08,949
Good morning.

238
00:15:09,033 --> 00:15:10,284
No way!

239
00:15:10,367 --> 00:15:11,577
Good morning, Akane.

240
00:15:12,244 --> 00:15:13,287
Good morning.

241
00:15:13,871 --> 00:15:17,291
Is it true? You're subbing
in the rhythmic gymnastics match?

242
00:15:17,374 --> 00:15:18,250
Yep, sure am.

243
00:15:18,334 --> 00:15:19,919
Awesome! Good luck with that.

244
00:15:20,002 --> 00:15:21,128
It won't be a problem!

245
00:15:21,837 --> 00:15:24,298
- Oh, I wanted to ask you...
- Hmm.

246
00:15:24,924 --> 00:15:27,343
- Malice?
- Akane Tendo.

247
00:15:27,426 --> 00:15:29,053
The time is now!

248
00:15:31,013 --> 00:15:32,973
It's you again?

249
00:15:33,057 --> 00:15:35,726
You got a lot of nerve jumping on me
first thing in the morning.

250
00:15:35,809 --> 00:15:37,311
Jumping on you?

251
00:15:37,394 --> 00:15:39,396
What an appalling accusation.

252
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,440
I was just coming up to say hello.

253
00:15:41,523 --> 00:15:43,317
I actually came all the way here...

254
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:44,944
...because I wanted to visit Lord Ranma.

255
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:47,071
Then why did you come after me at all?

256
00:15:47,154 --> 00:15:49,323
Why not go straight to Ranma!

257
00:15:52,701 --> 00:15:54,954
Please wait right there for me,
Lord Ranma.

258
00:15:55,037 --> 00:15:57,331
Huh? Can't stand that woman.

259
00:15:57,414 --> 00:15:58,415
Hmm?

260
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:00,209
Akane.

261
00:16:00,292 --> 00:16:02,836
I can already picture your gymnastics.

262
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,755
You're so, so elegant.

263
00:16:05,381 --> 00:16:08,550
Feel the fire of my encouragement
with these red roses.

264
00:16:09,176 --> 00:16:11,428
- I love you, Akane!
- Whoa!

265
00:16:11,929 --> 00:16:13,806
Why are you coming after me?

266
00:16:13,889 --> 00:16:15,766
Ranma Saotome.

267
00:16:15,849 --> 00:16:18,560
What grudge do you still possess
against me?

268
00:16:18,644 --> 00:16:21,563
You were the one who just came up
and attacked me out of nowhere--

269
00:16:22,106 --> 00:16:23,107
Hmm?

270
00:16:23,607 --> 00:16:24,775
Hmm?

271
00:16:25,401 --> 00:16:28,654
Ranma, it's you.

272
00:16:28,737 --> 00:16:30,197
Hmm.

273
00:16:31,156 --> 00:16:32,324
Lovely.

274
00:16:32,408 --> 00:16:33,409
What's that for?

275
00:16:34,326 --> 00:16:35,869
I permit you to date her.

276
00:16:35,953 --> 00:16:37,621
Wonderful, Lord Ranma.

277
00:16:37,705 --> 00:16:38,914
I need you to calm down.

278
00:16:38,998 --> 00:16:41,375
I'd never wanna date someone like you.

279
00:16:41,458 --> 00:16:42,876
Hmm?

280
00:16:44,086 --> 00:16:46,755
What do you feel for me? Is it hate?

281
00:16:46,839 --> 00:16:48,966
No, that's not it at all. I was just, uh...

282
00:16:49,049 --> 00:16:52,219
Ah, I forgot I already have
a fiancée right here.

283
00:16:52,302 --> 00:16:53,470
So I'm taken.

284
00:16:53,554 --> 00:16:54,763
Excuse me?

285
00:16:54,847 --> 00:16:56,849
Just take the bullet for me on this one.

286
00:16:56,932 --> 00:16:58,475
You really are something else.

287
00:16:58,559 --> 00:17:00,227
You have a fiancée?

288
00:17:00,310 --> 00:17:02,229
- You two are engaged?
- Mmm, a lover's quarrel.

289
00:17:02,312 --> 00:17:04,857
- Yeah, kinda.
- ...some sort of love triangle?

290
00:17:04,940 --> 00:17:07,359
How interesting.

291
00:17:08,819 --> 00:17:10,029
Whoa.

292
00:17:11,739 --> 00:17:13,073
What do you say to this?

293
00:17:13,157 --> 00:17:16,285
We bet Lord Ranma's hand
on the result of our upcoming match.

294
00:17:16,368 --> 00:17:18,746
- Huh?
- You wanna bet what?

295
00:17:18,829 --> 00:17:19,997
You gotta be joking--

296
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:22,499
- It's perfectly all right, Akane.
- Hmm?

297
00:17:23,083 --> 00:17:26,128
To have a clean break with Ranma,
all you need to do is lose.

298
00:17:26,211 --> 00:17:28,338
What?

299
00:17:28,422 --> 00:17:29,965
You won't need to throw the match

300
00:17:30,049 --> 00:17:32,342
because I'll smash you
into tiny little pieces.

301
00:17:34,094 --> 00:17:35,471
Lord Ranma.

302
00:17:35,554 --> 00:17:39,099
Prepare yourself to be mine
the moment the match has been completed.

303
00:17:42,352 --> 00:17:44,021
Good day to you.

304
00:17:44,104 --> 00:17:46,732
- Black roses?
- Whoa! A petal storm!

305
00:17:46,815 --> 00:17:48,567
Uh...

306
00:17:52,446 --> 00:17:55,407
That woman may be no better
than a raving pervert.

307
00:17:55,491 --> 00:17:57,117
But regardless, Ranma.

308
00:17:57,701 --> 00:17:59,578
Do take care of my little sister.

309
00:18:00,662 --> 00:18:01,663
Huh?

310
00:18:02,956 --> 00:18:05,751
Back it up a bit.
Say what you just said again.

311
00:18:06,543 --> 00:18:10,130
I said that you should do your best
to take care of my little sister.

312
00:18:11,799 --> 00:18:13,592
It might be strange
coming from her brother.

313
00:18:14,218 --> 00:18:16,345
At her core,
she is a relentless individual

314
00:18:16,428 --> 00:18:18,263
with a mean twist to her personality.

315
00:18:18,764 --> 00:18:19,765
Uh...

316
00:18:19,848 --> 00:18:23,143
But please, Akane, refrain from
getting hurt during the match.

317
00:18:24,144 --> 00:18:26,855
Once she locks on to a man,
she never lets go.

318
00:18:27,439 --> 00:18:29,566
I can guarantee the fight won't be clean.

319
00:18:30,442 --> 00:18:33,529
So,
that was Kuno's little sister?

320
00:18:34,238 --> 00:18:36,949
They do kinda look alike
now that I'm thinking about it.

321
00:18:39,451 --> 00:18:40,869
THE NIGHT BEFORE THE MATCH

322
00:18:49,002 --> 00:18:50,295
Whoa.

323
00:18:50,379 --> 00:18:51,380
Whoa.

324
00:18:52,631 --> 00:18:53,715
Ha! Ha! Hyah!

325
00:18:57,761 --> 00:18:59,221
Come on!

326
00:18:59,304 --> 00:19:00,389
Mmm.

327
00:19:00,472 --> 00:19:01,682
Hold still!

328
00:19:04,226 --> 00:19:06,145
- Hyah!
- Hup. Hmm.

329
00:19:06,228 --> 00:19:09,148
Quit jumping around
and let me practice on you!

330
00:19:10,399 --> 00:19:13,318
Wow! You've made
a lot of progress. Nice job!

331
00:19:13,402 --> 00:19:14,862
Don't patronize me.

332
00:19:14,945 --> 00:19:16,446
I just wanna say, Ranma.

333
00:19:16,530 --> 00:19:18,991
I hope you understand
that I'm not winning this match for you.

334
00:19:19,074 --> 00:19:21,118
Well, yeah. I already knew that.

335
00:19:21,201 --> 00:19:25,205
All right, then.
This isn't just about gymnastics.

336
00:19:25,289 --> 00:19:27,499
There's not much point in practicing
without a partner.

337
00:19:28,208 --> 00:19:32,504
Speaking of, Ryoga hasn't been around
at all for the last couple of days.

338
00:19:32,588 --> 00:19:34,006
I was really counting on him.

339
00:19:34,089 --> 00:19:36,466
Hmm?

340
00:19:36,550 --> 00:19:38,093
P-chan!

341
00:19:40,846 --> 00:19:43,432
I don't think
I've seen you around very much either.

342
00:19:43,515 --> 00:19:45,142
Where have you been, huh?

343
00:19:45,225 --> 00:19:48,103
You picked up momiji manju from Hiroshima

344
00:19:48,187 --> 00:19:49,730
and something else from Kyoto?

345
00:19:51,315 --> 00:19:54,401
Oh, P-chan. I wonder
where you were really trying to go.

346
00:19:54,484 --> 00:19:57,362
I know that your sense of direction
completely sucks.

347
00:19:57,446 --> 00:19:59,531
Mmm.

348
00:19:59,615 --> 00:20:00,991
What about his sense of direction?

349
00:20:01,074 --> 00:20:03,118
You're talking to him like he's Ryoga.

350
00:20:05,370 --> 00:20:06,830
All righty, then.

351
00:20:06,914 --> 00:20:08,582
Time to practice.

352
00:20:08,665 --> 00:20:10,834
I already told you earlier
not to pick on him.

353
00:20:13,337 --> 00:20:14,338
There we go.

354
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:20,636
Finally motivated to help me out, huh?

355
00:20:21,261 --> 00:20:22,930
Okay, then. Here I go!

356
00:20:23,013 --> 00:20:25,140
Hut!

357
00:20:42,115 --> 00:20:44,451
There. That should do it, Akane.

358
00:20:46,536 --> 00:20:50,165
Pretty clumsy, Sis. Surprised
you tripped over yourself like that.

359
00:20:50,749 --> 00:20:53,877
Unfortunately, you'll have to withdraw
from the match tomorrow.

360
00:20:53,961 --> 00:20:55,462
I'll still fight.

361
00:20:55,545 --> 00:20:57,673
I'm not letting her win if I can help it.

362
00:20:57,756 --> 00:20:59,675
Ah! Don't put too much weight on it.

363
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:01,760
Are you okay?

364
00:21:01,843 --> 00:21:02,928
Ow, ow, it hurts.

365
00:21:03,011 --> 00:21:05,806
Oh, no. You have to find
someone else to replace you.

366
00:21:05,889 --> 00:21:07,474
You make it sound so easy.

367
00:21:07,975 --> 00:21:11,228
A girl who's agile enough,
in really good shape

368
00:21:11,311 --> 00:21:13,981
and is a martial arts expert
who's readily available...

369
00:21:15,065 --> 00:21:16,066
Huh?

370
00:21:18,735 --> 00:21:22,072
What? Hang on.
Stop looking at me like that.

371
00:21:22,155 --> 00:21:23,949
I'm not getting shoved into a leotard.

372
00:21:26,994 --> 00:21:28,620
We'll be up all night training.

373
00:21:29,871 --> 00:21:30,872
Huh?
